          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu ariphomuona Benjamini, mwanao ndani mwenga, waamba, “Yuno ndiye mwenenu wenu chiziyanda mriyeniambira?” Chisha achimuamba Benjamini, “Mlungu naakuonere mbazi, mwanangu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Yusufu wauka gafula, mana matsozi kala ganamrengarenga kpwa sababu ya kumuona nduguye. Achiinjira mwakpwe chumbani na achirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kusinga uso watuluka kondze, achidzidinisa chilume na achiamba, “Reheni chakurya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
