          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu warya macheye na nduguze nao achirya machiyao. Amisiri okala hipho nao achirya machiyao, mana aho kurya na Aeburania kala ni utu wa kutsukiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho asagala mezani kulolana na Yusufu, na apangbwa kulengana na miaka yao, kula mvyere hadi mdide; hino yaahenda alolane kpwa kuangalala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sababu ya kuangalala yakala ko kupangbwa kula mvyere hadi mdide.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakurya kala chichihalwa mezani pha Yusufu na akahewa. Benjamini wahewa chakurya kano tsano ya chira cha ayae. Anwa, achirya vyakurya vinono-vinono na achifwahirwa phamwenga na Yusufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.34"
            ]
          }
        }
